# Dependency
Updates to dependencies (npm packages, GitHub Actions)
Bump patch: auto-merge if CI passes
Bump minor: require review
Bump major: require review + manual testing

# Security
Fixes for security vulnerabilities
Auto-merge if CI passes and severity is HIGH or CRITICAL

# Feature
New features and improvements
Requires review by @libriopal
CI must pass
At least 1 approval required

# Bug Fix
Fixes for existing bugs
Requires review
CI must pass

# Documentation
Documentation-only changes
Auto-merge if CI passes
No approval required

# Refactor
Code refactoring without behavior change
Requires review
CI must pass
